    },
    {
      "tutorialType": "TutorialType_GameStart",
      "step": 3,
      "subStep": 1,
      "texts": []
    },
    {
      "tutorialType": "TutorialType_GameStart",
      "step": 6,
      "subStep": 1,
      "texts": [
        "训练完成恭喜！\n達成訓練的目標\n可以获得奖励哦"
      ]
    },
    {
      "tutorialType": "TutorialType_GameStart",
      "step": 6,
      "subStep": 2,
      "texts": [
        "看起來可以從中選擇一個呢\n這次就領取這張技能卡\n试试看吧！"
      ]
    },
    {
      "tutorialType": "TutorialType_GameStart",
      "step": 6,
      "subStep": 3,
      "texts": []
    },
    {
      "tutorialType": "TutorialType_GameStart",
      "step": 6,
      "subStep": 4,
      "texts": [
        "完成训练目标后，\n可以獲得對培育有用的獎勵。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "tutorialType": "TutorialType_GameStart",
      "step": 9,
      "subStep": 1,
      "texts": []
    },
    {
      "tutorialType": "TutorialType_GameStart",
      "step": 10,
      "subStep": 1,
      "texts": [
        "体力好像变少了呢"
      ]
    },
    {
      "tutorialType": "TutorialType_GameStart",
      "step": 10,
      "subStep": 2,
      "texts": [
        "选择“休息”\n让偶像休息一会吧"
      ]
    },
    {
      "tutorialType": "TutorialType_GameStart",
      "step": 10,
      "subStep": 3,
      "texts": [
        "体力变少时，用“休息”恢复体力\n為考試和訓練做好準備吧。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "tutorialType": "TutorialType_GameStart",
      "step": 10,
      "subStep": 4,
      "texts": []
    },
    {
      "tutorialType": "TutorialType_GameStart",
      "step": 11,
      "subStep": 1,
      "texts": [
        "和其他偶像競爭得分\n进入前三名即可合格。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "tutorialType": "TutorialType_GameStart",
      "step": 12,
      "subStep": 1,
      "texts": [
        "使用與訓練相同的技能卡，\n提升得分进行排名竞争"
      ]
    },
    {
      "tutorialType": "TutorialType_GameStart",
      "step": 12,
      "subStep": 2,
      "texts": [
        "这里可以确认当前的得分与排名"
      ]
    },
    {
      "tutorialType": "TutorialType_GameStart",
      "step": 12,
      "subStep": 3,
      "texts": [
        "考试结束时，\n若在三位以內即為合格哦"
      ]
    },
    {
      "tutorialType": "TutorialType_GameStart",
      "step": 12,
      "subStep": 4,
      "texts": [
        "立刻使用技能卡\n提升得分吧！"
      ]
    },
    {
      "tutorialType": "TutorialType_GameStart",
      "step": 12,
      "subStep": 5,
      "texts": [
        "比訓練時大幅上升了呢\n考试时根据分数，\n得分会有加成"
      ]
    },
    {
      "tutorialType": "TutorialType_GameStart",
      "step": 12,
      "subStep": 6,
      "texts": [
        "加成可以在這裡確認\n每回合加成会变化\n請注意哦！"
      ]
    },
    {
      "tutorialType": "TutorialType_GameStart",
      "step": 12,
      "subStep": 7,
      "texts": [
        "那么还有三回合\n考试加油！"
      ]
    },
    {
      "tutorialType": "TutorialType_GameStart",
      "step": 12,
      "subStep": 8,
      "texts": [
        "考试中每回合得分有加成。\n分數越高得分加成的值就越大。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "tutorialType": "TutorialType_GameStart",
      "step": 12,
      "subStep": 9,
      "texts": []
    },
    {
      "tutorialType": "TutorialType_GameStart",
      "step": 13,
      "subStep": 1,
      "texts": []
    },
    {
      "tutorialType": "TutorialType_GameStart",
      "step": 14,
      "subStep": 1,
      "texts": []
    },
    {
      "tutorialType": "TutorialType_GameStart",
      "step": 15,
      "subStep": 1,
      "texts": [
        "直播中最多可以拍摄50次\n記錄下偶像的身影吧！"
      ]
    },
    {
      "tutorialType": "TutorialType_GameStart",
      "step": 16,
      "subStep": 1,
      "texts": [
        "透過培育結果和偶像的成長\n決定可以參與的直播。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "tutorialType": "TutorialType_GameStart",
      "step": 16,
      "subStep": 2,
      "texts": [
        "培育的結果\n可以作为“回忆”\n获得哦"
      ]
    },
    {
      "tutorialType": "TutorialType_GameStart",
      "step": 16,
      "subStep": 3,
      "texts": [
        "根據培育的評價\n回憶的效能會變化。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "tutorialType": "TutorialType_GameStart",
      "step": 16,
      "subStep": 4,
      "texts": [
        "可以選擇成為“回憶”的照片哦！\n選擇你喜歡的照片試試看吧"
      ]
    },
    {
      "tutorialType": "TutorialType_GameStart",
      "step": 17,
      "subStep": 1,
      "texts": []
    },
    {
      "tutorialType": "TutorialType_GameStart",
      "step": 17,
      "subStep": 2,
      "texts": [
        "製作人Lv上升時，會解鎖新的技能卡和\nP飲料等，並在培育中出現。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "tutorialType": "TutorialType_GameStart",
      "step": 4,
      "subStep": 1,
      "texts": [
        "好了，培育開始了呢\n這次考試特別的只有最終考試哦\n我會幫你緊跟的，請放心吧！"
      ]
    },
    {
      "tutorialType": "TutorialType_GameStart",
      "step": 4,
      "subStep": 2,
      "texts": [
        "通过考试，争取参加演唱会吧。\n要参演演唱会，\n必須透過期中考試和最終考試。",
        "為了透過考試，\n偶像的分數很重要。\n准备考试时培养分数吧。",
        "每次考试都有审查标准。\n如果能根据审查标准来培养分数，\n就更容易透過考試了。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "tutorialType": "TutorialType_GameStart",
      "step": 4,
      "subStep": 3,
      "texts": [
        "在這裡可以確認偶像的分數、建議、\n审查标准"
      ]
    },
    {
      "tutorialType": "TutorialType_GameStart",
      "step": 4,
      "subStep": 4,
      "texts": [
        "首先进行舞蹈课\n提升舞蹈力吧！"
      ]
    },
    {
      "tutorialType": "TutorialType_GameStart",
      "step": 5,
      "subStep": 1,
      "texts": []
    },
    {
      "tutorialType": "TutorialType_GameStart",
      "step": 5,
      "subStep": 2,
      "texts": [
        "可以在這裡確認到\n通關所需的分數和\n目前偶像的分數哦"
      ]
    },
    {
      "tutorialType": "TutorialType_GameStart",
      "step": 5,
      "subStep": 3,
      "texts": [
        "訓練中可以在固定的回合數內\n进行行动\n這次似乎還剩下3回合呢！"
      ]
    },
    {
      "tutorialType": "TutorialType_GameStart",
      "step": 5,
      "subStep": 4,
      "texts": [
        "在訓練中\n可以選擇在這裡的技能卡\n进行使用哦"
      ]
    },
    {
      "tutorialType": "TutorialType_GameStart",
      "step": 5,
      "subStep": 5,
      "texts": [
        "赶紧试着使用吧！"
      ]
    },
    {
      "tutorialType": "TutorialType_GameStart",
      "step": 5,
      "subStep": 6,
      "texts": [
        "舞蹈力的分數上升\n離訓練通關更近了呢！"
      ]
    },
    {
      "tutorialType": "TutorialType_GameStart",
      "step": 5,
      "subStep": 7,
      "texts": [
        "體力在下降呢\n使用技能卡时\n可能需要体力"
      ]
    },
    {
      "tutorialType": "TutorialType_GameStart",
      "step": 5,
      "subStep": 8,
      "texts": [
        "接下来试试选择这张技能卡吧！"
      ]
    },
    {
      "tutorialType": "TutorialType_GameStart",
      "step": 5,
      "subStep": 9,
      "texts": [
        "{ExamEffectType.ExamBlock}元氣上升了呢！\n{ExamEffectType.ExamBlock}元氣在體力下降時，\n會優先作為體力的替代消耗"
      ]
    },
    {
      "tutorialType": "TutorialType_GameStart",
      "step": 5,
      "subStep": 10,
      "texts": [
        "",
        "技能卡的使用需要體力。\n當有元氣時，可以用元氣作為體力的替代消耗\n来使用技能卡。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "tutorialType": "TutorialType_GameStart",
      "step": 5,
      "subStep": 11,
      "texts": [
        "最后再选择一张试试吧！"
      ]
    },
    {
      "tutorialType": "TutorialType_GameStart",
      "step": 7,
      "subStep": 1,
      "texts": [
        "接下来选择歌唱课\n试试看吧"
      ]
    },
    {
      "tutorialType": "TutorialType_GameStart",
      "step": 8,
      "subStep": 1,
      "texts": []
    },
    {
      "tutorialType": "TutorialType_GameStart",
      "step": 8,
      "subStep": 2,
      "texts": [
        "上次訓練獲得的\n技能卡在手牌裡呢\n试着选择看看吧！"
      ]
    },
    {
      "tutorialType": "TutorialType_GameStart",
      "step": 8,
      "subStep": 3,
      "texts": [
        "受技能卡效果影响\n附加了{ExamEffectType.ExamLessonBuff}集中！"
      ]
    },
    {
      "tutorialType": "TutorialType_GameStart",
      "step": 8,
      "subStep": 4,
      "texts": [
        "可以通过点击图标\n来确认当前效果\n讓我們看看{ExamEffectType.ExamLessonBuff}集中的效果吧！"
      ]
    },
    {
      "tutorialType": "TutorialType_GameStart",
      "step": 8,
      "subStep": 5,
      "texts": [
        "{ExamEffectType.ExamLessonBuff}集中似乎有增加\n上升分數的效果呢"
      ]
    },
    {
      "tutorialType": "TutorialType_GameStart",
      "step": 8,
      "subStep": 6,
      "texts": [
        "所持的P道具效果也可以透過\n点击图标进行确认哦"
      ]
    },
    {
      "tutorialType": "TutorialType_GameStart",
      "step": 8,
      "subStep": 7,
      "texts": [
        "現在持有的P道具\n{ExamEffectType.ExamLessonBuff}集中和似乎很合適呢"
      ]
    },
    {
      "tutorialType": "TutorialType_GameStart",
      "step": 8,
      "subStep": 8,
      "texts": [
        "在附帶{ExamEffectType.ExamLessonBuff}集中狀態下\n选择技能卡试试看吧！"
      ]
    },
    {
      "tutorialType": "TutorialType_GameStart",
      "step": 8,
      "subStep": 9,
      "texts": [
        "多虧了{ExamEffectType.ExamLessonBuff}集中\n分數大大增加了呢"
      ]
    },
    {
      "tutorialType": "TutorialType_GameStart",
      "step": 8,
      "subStep": 10,
      "texts": [
        "而且，因為P道具的效果\n{ExamEffectType.ExamLessonBuff}集中增加了呢！"
      ]
    },
    {
      "tutorialType": "TutorialType_GameStart",
      "step": 8,
      "subStep": 11,
      "texts": [
        "訓練中的效果可以透過\n点击图标确认详细信息。",
        "P道具在滿足條件後會生效。\n一開始持有的P道具由培育用偶像決定。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "tutorialType": "TutorialType_GameStart",
      "step": 8,
      "subStep": 12,
      "texts": [
        "活用到目前為止學到的內容\n尽可能多地培养分数\n請加油試試看！"
      ]
    },
    {
      "tutorialType": "TutorialType_GameStart",
      "step": 8,
      "subStep": 13,
      "texts": [
        "没问题，你一定能做到的！"
      ]
    },
    {
      "tutorialType": "TutorialType_GameStart",
      "step": 8,
      "subStep": 14,
      "texts": [
        "没问题，你一定能做到的！"
      ]
    },
